These were ported by patching the compiled pi-tui dist (components/editor.js, components/select-list.js, components/settings-list.js, autocomplete.js) + pi-coding-agent dist/modes/interactive/interactive-mode.js and dist/modes/interactive/theme/theme.js; reapply with `bash ~/.pi/agent/prime-tui/apply-patches.sh` after any npm update of pi-coding-agent. settings-list.js is patched because stock pi 0.84.1 regressed space-toggle in the /settings menu: it only toggled while the search box was empty, so typing a query made Space insert a space into the search text instead of toggling the selected option. The patch (matching the prime fork's TS source) makes Space always toggle the selected item and strips spaces from search input. Verified fixed by user on 2026-08-08. interactive-mode.js is patched to fix a quit bug (fullscreen mode): the editor's background surface block rendered with extra rows below the editor on the final quit frame and lingered after exit; the fix stops the TUI with `preserveScreen: true` so the final frame stays clean. Patched copies live under ~/.pi/agent/prime-tui/patched/ and are wired into apply-patches.sh. <!-- created=2026-08-08, last=2026-08-08 -->